menu "Wendy ESP-NOW link"
    config WENDY_ESPNOW
        bool "ESP-NOW link: time-sync beacons and a carrier for the mesh leaf"
        default n
        depends on WENDY_WIFI_ENABLED
        help
            Listens for signed soundsync beacons (SSB1) from an Anchor dongle
            and logs their hardware receive time on the esp_timer clock, the
            reference-broadcast time sync of the acoustic nodes. Beacons stay
            plain ESP-NOW broadcasts so their receive stamps are untouched.

            Also carries the signed mesh leaf: a TCP listener on 127.0.0.1
            whose bytes travel over a reliable ESP-NOW stream to the Anchor,
            which relays them to its WendyOS agent's leaf listener. The leaf's
            mutually authenticated TLS runs end to end over it. Hackathon
            feature.

    config WENDY_ESPNOW_PROXY_PORT
        int "Local TCP port of the mesh carrier proxy"
        depends on WENDY_ESPNOW
        default 43124

    config WENDY_ESPNOW_LOG_BEACONS
        bool "Log every beacon's receive time (B lines)"
        depends on WENDY_ESPNOW
        default y

    config WENDY_ESPNOW_LOG_AP_BEACONS
        bool "Also log the receive time of the associated AP's beacons (A lines)"
        depends on WENDY_ESPNOW
        default n
        help
            For measuring time sync against any other receiver on the channel,
            without a second node. Turns promiscuous receive of management
            frames on.
endmenu
